---
layout: base.njk
title: KKY
description: Notes on agent tooling, research, and the things I build.
permalink: /
---
<div class="home-intro">
  <p>
    Hi — I build <em>agent tooling</em>: MCP servers, multi-agent workflows, and
    the small pieces of plumbing that make coding agents usable day to day.
  </p>
  <p>
    I also compete on Kaggle, and I like quantitative problems where the data
    argues back.
  </p>
  <p>
    This is where I write it down: what I built, what broke, and what actually
    moved the numbers.
  </p>
</div>

{% if projects and projects.length %}
<section class="section-block" id="projects">
  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for item in projects %}
      <div class="project-item">
        <h3>
          <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>{% if item.tag %}<span class="project-tag">{{ item.tag }}</span>{% endif %}
        </h3>
        <p>
          {{ item.description }}
          {% if item.meta %}<span class="project-meta">{{ item.meta }}</span>{% endif %}
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if collections.posts.length %}
<section class="section-block" id="writing">
  <h2>Writing</h2>
  <ul class="writing-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 8 %}
        <li>
          <span class="writing-date">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</span>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/posts/">All posts →</a></p>
</section>
{% endif %}
